        text: "The last leg is the longest, about twenty minutes. Take Harper Avenue south back to 55th, jog east to Lake Park, and follow Lake Park and then Stony Island south. Past the Midway, the granite tower rising out of Jackson Park is the Obama Presidential Center. Enter the campus from Stony Island.",
